  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:elekha_adonai_nafshenu">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/1"/>Unto You, Adonoy, we lift up our souls.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/2"/>We lift our hearts with our hands
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/3"/>to the Almighty in heaven.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/4"/>For Your sake, we are murdered all the day,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/5"/>we are considered as sheep for the slaughter.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/6"/>Be aroused!
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/7"/>Why do You appear as asleep, my Master?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/8"/>Awaken, do not forsake us forever.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/44/25"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/9"/>Why do You conceal Your Presence,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/10"/>have You forgotten our suffering
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/11"/>and our oppression?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/12"/>For our souls are bowed to the dust,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/13"/>our bowels cling to the earth.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/44/27"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/14"/>Arise—come to our aid
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_nafshenu/15"/>and redeem us for the sake of Your kindness.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
